//   mcu            AHB-Lite   router [1, 1]
// Slave ports (the NoC is the master):
//   ddr0           AXI4       router [0, 1]  0x80000000 (interleaved)
//   ddr1           AXI4       router [1, 1]  0x80000000 (interleaved)
//   ddr2           AXI4       router [0, 1]  0x80000000 (interleaved)
//   ddr3           AXI4       router [1, 1]  0x80000000 (interleaved)
//   sram           AXI4       router [0, 1]  0x00000000
//   xsram          AXI4-Lite  router [0, 0]  0x20000000
//   periph         AXI4       router [1, 1]  0x10000000
// AXI4 IDs are ID_WIDTH bits; responses come back in order per master port.
// AXI4-Lite, AHB-Lite and APB4 ports go through noc_axi2lite / noc_ahb2axi /
// noc_axi2ahb / axi2apb_bridge in front of the network interface.
// ============================================================================
